        "observations": "Actually inspected full wide view from Palatine: high flattened podium with a low polygonal/fan-shaped modern canopy above the altar recess, several separate massive rough concrete cores with exposed brick patches and irregular tops, low marble fragments and independent neighboring Forum ruins. This is a ruin complex rather than an intact classical temple."
